OL,3,GNEWSAAuthor shares how books have
OL,4,A'magical way' of reaching you when
OL,5,Astruggling
OL,6,
OL,7,FBooks have a "magical way" of reaching
OL,8,Fyou when you need them most - and when
OL,9,Fyou are struggling, they "make you feel
OL,10,Funderstood", an author has said.
OL,12,FThe writer of bestselling book The
OL,13,FMidnight Library, Matt Haig, was a
OL,14,Fspecial guest at the Cheltenham
OL,15,FLiterature Festival on Saturday.
OL,17,FHe said it would be a chance to connect
OL,18,Fwith his fans and hopefully inspire
OL,19,Fyounger readers to experience the joy
OL,20,Fand healing of reading without the
OL,21,F"nonsense snobbery" that society puts
OL,22,Fon it.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
