OL,3,GNEWSAAuthor shares how books have
OL,4,A'magical way' of reaching you when
OL,5,Astruggling
OL,6,
OL,7,FHaig said he had ADHD and struggled
OL,8,Fwith school, and at the time found
OL,9,Fhimself "on the cusp of stopping
OL,10,Freading for life" because he thought he
OL,11,Fwas the type of person "that shouldn't
OL,12,Fbe reading".
